    "text": "Community organization to hold meeting in City of Cave on Thursday, Aug. 13\nBy\nL. A. MyersOn Thursday, Aug. 13, a community organization will host a Celebrate Recovery meeting at Cave City First Assembly of God in the City of Cave.\nThe event is set to start at 5:45 p.m. at Cave City First Assembly of God.\nCommunity members interested in attending are encouraged to participate and engage in local discussions.",
